  "point": "The left bundle is blocked, so the LV is activated late and slowly, through muscle instead of Purkinje fibres. Septal activation reverses. Click V1: the vector spends the whole QRS pointing away from it, which is why V1 shows a broad deep QS. The Tier-3 sweep stretches but keeps the normal route - that is exactly where the model stops being true.",
